    <briefdescription>
<para>A line style that renders the curve as a customisable dashed line. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>pattern</computeroutput> property accepts a list of alternating dash and gap lengths in pixels, following the same convention as SVG <computeroutput>stroke-dasharray</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1SolidLine" kindref="compound">SolidLine</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1NoLine" kindref="compound">NoLine</ref>, <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineStyle" kindref="compound">LineStyle</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
